  <DocumentRef DateTime="20260818T162010" id="a35c2fca-94bd-4faa-a442-9f43673d6470">
    <XRef DateTime="20260818T161930" id="0923675e-187c-4525-b572-a8ef0857c9fa"/>
  </DocumentRef>

  <Content>
    <Paragraph Label="Scene 1" Type="New Act" id="03254032-ba6b-4137-a15f-5226dbf7d214">
      <Text>Act I</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Info" id="c4991dc9-c78e-42e1-985d-061b649af3c4">
      <Text Style="Bold+Underline+AllCaps">Scene 1</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Info" id="50f2c0d7-30e8-4473-94ad-ce600d432ea2">
      <Text Style="Bold+Underline+AllCaps">





















Scene +</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="95831705-0db5-4c99-99ad-8c1fe5ed9eab">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 5/8" Page="1" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="DESTINY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="FRAILTY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="REALITY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text Style="Bold+AllCaps">Spacetime Headquarters</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0ccee382-faf0-4316-80ab-a270530ce2ec">
      <Text>Reality frantically stares at the timeline as Frailty and Destiny enter, giggling.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="89fa32b7-a8bb-455f-a386-308566db0f98">
      <Text>Reality</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="452726d5-e1d4-4d4b-812d-e7539aab62b8">
      <Text>You two cannot be going around playing Cupid!!!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="General" id="03815ed9-9e85-445a-bfed-a7990bcee62d">
      <DualDialogue>
        <SpellCheckIgnoreLists>
          <IgnoredRanges/>
          <IgnoredWords/>
        </SpellCheckIgnoreLists>
        <Paragraph Type="Character" id="21acb387-926a-44e7-865f-d832b7af1cfe">
          <Text>Frailty</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5fe64969-b6ea-40a1-b078-045303aa6684">
          <Text>Cupid won’t </Text>
          <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">knowth</Text>
          <Text>, they’re on a journey.
We’ve started something extraordinary.</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5feba8a2-580f-49f2-b016-6c895d9aed67">
          <Text>Destiny</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f9c49d2b-9eb0-456e-9e3a-5b3e0ad2cbe5">
          <Text>They ain’t gonna know, they’re on vacay.
I ship ¡Tab &amp; Coda!</Text>
        </Paragraph>
      </DualDialogue>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="29b6ef28-7fb2-4a26-9bc7-133b4ced59e3">
      <Text>Reality</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="84de64b1-2058-4a44-a889-bc898bf31e1a">
      <Text>We’ve got to get Tabitha and Dakota back in their timelines, or it’ll be our own pasts, presents, and futures on the line!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c174a000-dd0a-49a4-85ba-1d89f95802cd">
      <Text>DestINY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="1f5ea33c-7247-41cd-a9d4-0d2ec7d0547e">
      <Text>(Acting cute)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="415f2283-972c-4e74-84b1-1c374d2cbae9">
      <Text>Eternity ain’t gonna take it out on us...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="889878ad-93d0-4c5e-ae6a-8ec45de1d83e">
      <Text>FraILTY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="fd3435e1-d65a-4767-9d2b-417026bd0f4e">
      <Text>They will ensure the Conductor won’t see tomorrow, or yesterday, or today.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b7726d56-e335-483f-b340-879396554b3f">
      <Text>The Conductor stops conducting.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ed79caf4-ebf4-468b-8210-f07004149285">
      <Text>Reality</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="85018053-e32a-415c-81c5-f9da9631f993">
      <Text>Keep conducting! You heard nothing.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="69d29387-3794-4ab4-8e78-1a802dae6c52">
      <Text>DestinY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="afe0511a-37b5-43e4-8a11-50a67e10d9ab">
      <Text>What happens if that happens?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6e660e44-4acd-41c7-b9e9-02fdd0dd4449">
      <Text>REALITY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4209ae8d-ccd7-4f3a-8bd6-f3755ba354e6">
      <Text>Madam/Sir Eternity will erase the entire timeline and take it to the Higher Ups to reorchestrate history.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6e65b2be-f209-4534-b059-98ac19f5c3bf">
      <Text>FraILTY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="baf2ee83-b86d-4109-9414-be4847d09072">
      <Text>Gone will be my trees and dolls...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ec2a33a8-027e-4933-b428-0292a7606b06">
      <Text>REALITY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="536f04ae-89e5-4c48-aaff-869774411f8a">
      <Text>My toy boats and model trains...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0ab69699-9c0b-4120-a3cd-9648356d20d8">
      <Text>DestINY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e4050918-7b9d-46e1-956d-8bac2aafcfa8">
      <Text>My followers on TikTok...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="33da72fd-fa9b-411d-bcfd-e626d7d7f4ae">
      <Text>Frailty and Reality stare down Destiny.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="982c9e62-0106-4f47-bd98-2499119a1f6c">
      <Text>DestINY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d27c9a89-7576-44f2-916b-1abf983e4055">
      <Text>It’s what I named my cuckoo clock...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="adfd13f4-78e3-43d8-957d-30bc8d0761e5">
      <Text>RealITY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="23437cb2-efc7-4437-afcf-8ff19390514e">
      <Text>The Higher Ups will not make a Tyrannosaurus Rex the same way.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="662bf4e8-f779-4f4e-9fec-6d9c84f3e363">
      <Text>FraiLTY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="015a5fd4-b332-44fb-89fc-9815979a7ab4">
      <Text>They could do without the feathers this time.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3b1fd8e5-159f-4ec5-83b4-c608021eab78">
      <Text>DestINY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9cd23440-6791-4d06-b0b0-88369911bf0e">
      <Text>Dead-tex. They had feathers?!!! So demure...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4ee15cfd-746d-4ddc-aa10-d8aece3c338b">
      <Text>ReaLITY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5c6819a0-ec9a-44b2-a6ea-621054e95b62">
      <Text>You were on TikTok cuckoo clock when you shoulda paid attention in our history classes.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="General" id="01729ab3-4f4f-4de6-8c6e-717f2abe5229">
      <Text>













</Text>    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Info" id="50f2c0d7-30e8-4473-94ad-ce600d432ea2">
      <Text Style="Bold+Underline+AllCaps">Scene +</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="95831705-0db5-4c99-99ad-8c1fe5ed9eab">
      <SceneProperties Length="1/8" Page="3" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text Style="Bold+AllCaps">Ext. Switzerland - Day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="065b0f68-df09-4f95-8cde-20a39c54ea28">
      <SceneProperties Length="3 7/8" Page="3" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="AUDIENCE MEMBER">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="DAKOTA">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="DAKOTA &amp; ROMANTICS">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="ROMANTICS">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="TABITHA">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="TABITHA &amp; DAKOTA">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="TABITHA &amp; ROMANTICS">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="TABITHA, DAKOTA, ROMANTICS">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="TIDAL[S]">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text Style="Underline+AllCaps">7. “</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Color="#00000000FEFE" Font="Arial" Style="Underline+AllCaps">אפשררי</Text>
      <Text Color="#00000000FEFE" Style="Underline+AllCaps"> (</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Color="#00000000FEFE" Style="Underline+AllCaps">Efshari</Text>
      <Text Color="#00000000FEFE" Style="Underline+AllCaps">, Anything’s Possible)</Text>
      <Text Style="Underline+AllCaps">”</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="30dee92c-b31a-4f74-856c-aa48bf03fc54">
      <Text>Dakota</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3f3ecfd9-37a0-48c9-ade8-0c0831435e9d">
      <Text>We can’t get home. I’m sorry. It’s impossible.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7b194350-32dd-4196-90c9-adb3c021f3e1">
      <Text>Tabitha</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="34b6705f-443f-46d8-a980-9e9d702c0685">
      <Text>I’m sorry you believe life is impossible.
But impossible is not... “</Text>
      <Text Style="Italic+AllCaps">impossible!</Text>
      <Text>”</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b81c8f28-6f82-43bd-b01b-4c018f3e6fc3">
      <Text>DakotA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="792bf44a-d2d9-4ecb-ab62-19a74fc23b77">
      <Text>Watcha mean? </Text>
      <Text Style="Italic">Impossible</Text>
      <Text> is </Text>
      <Text Style="Italic">impossible</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d2a31147-5fee-40e4-92b6-2eac6e1d0588">
      <Text>TABITHA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8c4cfb22-0565-4d48-9958-ba41f5b81432">
      <Text>There’s no such thing as “impossible!”</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="21bd5bb5-0749-4b6c-8302-f40a417b4269">
      <Text>DAKOTA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7df6df5e-6c58-4da9-ae4c-9c3e5227ac8e">
      <Text>Well, you’re impossible.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="643ba5ad-6b27-4497-bf1e-2667659e8307">
      <Text>TABITHA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="8753bb4c-fbea-48ee-bfc8-238032537c4a">
      <Text>You sorry excuse for a hu-</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="8cb85d85-48c5-43f7-9ab3-e1c4618d157f">
      <Text>(Clears throat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="3c58f9c8-3a1d-4f23-bd3a-ec9625ca823e">
      <Text>Man, you think so little of yourself.

Anything.
Everything&gt;
do believe: </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Hakol</Text>
      <Text> </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">efshari</Text>
      <Text>. (.</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Font="Arial">אפשרי</Text>
      <Text Font="Arial"> </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Font="Arial">הכל</Text>
      <Text>)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="153e6cca-11d8-4fb4-85f8-7f02922dc623">
      <Text>Romantics</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="389b2398-3945-429c-8a56-04a23b87f608">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Efshari</Text>
      <Text>! (!</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Font="Arial">אפשרי</Text>
      <Text>)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="14a2670d-51e5-4cf0-bb40-ce60f1fae274">
      <Text>DaKOTA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="dfc7f73c-685e-4309-a634-dcfa6a11c8b7">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Efshari</Text>
      <Text>? (?</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Font="Arial">אפשרי</Text>
      <Text>)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="65806bea-090a-48fa-b4b1-43f3b0ae0cd1">
      <Text>TabiTHA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="fe4ca3bf-7667-4343-b908-90636eb66021">
      <Text>That is your middle name!
Loud and proud: </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b5ec2035-e5b4-41dc-8ce1-f01beb918e83">
      <Text>Tabitha &amp; Romantics</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="fe4ca3bf-7667-4343-b908-90636eb66021">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Hakol</Text>
      <Text> </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">efshari</Text>
      <Text>! (!</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Font="Arial">אפשרי</Text>
      <Text Font="Arial"> </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Font="Arial">הכל</Text>
      <Text>)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="60becd36-8dae-4281-8c8b-2b3d7023a466">
      <Text>DakOTA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="229aebab-04e6-48e7-9e17-794f1292292b">
      <Text>Surely... breaking the laws of physics is improbable.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5086418d-c818-4f88-8f38-cc9ed31361e6">
      <Text>TabiTHA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="cbab3e49-36f9-4f14-b6ec-110393a180ba">
      <Text>And...?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="General" id="fc59cc87-3c93-42b7-8caa-3e4eff3cd14f">
      <DualDialogue>
        <SpellCheckIgnoreLists>
          <IgnoredRanges/>
          <IgnoredWords/>
        </SpellCheckIgnoreLists>
        <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6bdcfbfa-011d-4deb-85cf-51e1f83fd2ce">
          <Text>Tabitha</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="c4c43f9f-fcc1-4cfb-b97b-730c5e4af1f6">
          <Text>We are... unstoppable!</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1f7139fb-b0c4-47b9-a0c7-791ad0bca837">
          <Text>Dakota</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="8846bcd5-f953-4acb-8ea3-122d2876124b">
          <Text>And improbable is not... Impossible!</Text>
        </Paragraph>
      </DualDialogue>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="aebee37c-abf9-4e56-9de5-cc3f665e5149">
      <Text>RoMANTICS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="5adf0197-862e-454b-8b66-bf3784fd23ae">
      <Text>Anything./Possible./Everything.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="23ab6c8a-866e-44c6-adb4-8c266be3f07a">
      <Text>TabiTHA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="a7b65c5a-16be-473b-bcf0-145f2a925a92">
      <Text>Do believe: </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Hakol</Text>
      <Text> </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">efshari</Text>
      <Text>. (.</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Font="Arial">אפשרי</Text>
      <Text Font="Arial"> </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Font="Arial">הכל</Text>
      <Text>)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="General" id="f90818fe-8d6f-4fa2-9d6f-1ee0ef69774c">
      <DualDialogue>
        <SpellCheckIgnoreLists>
          <IgnoredRanges/>
          <IgnoredWords/>
        </SpellCheckIgnoreLists>
        <Paragraph Type="Character" id="bd274983-16a8-4808-9349-6c8c884910e3">
          <Text>Dakota</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="cba5cb19-6758-48d3-84b0-2fc9a8f05136">
          <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Hakol</Text>
          <Text> </Text>
          <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">efshari</Text>
          <Text>... (.</Text>
          <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Font="Arial">אפשרי</Text>
          <Text Font="Arial"> </Text>
          <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Font="Arial">הכל</Text>
          <Text>)</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Character" id="432fa809-c932-41f0-bc1e-3dd6b22c26b8">
          <Text>Romantics</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="b167919b-1ae5-4ab1-8bb5-55c9c21f61be">
          <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Hakol</Text>
          <Text> </Text>
          <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">efshari</Text>
          <Text>! (!</Text>
          <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Font="Arial">אפשרי</Text>
          <Text Font="Arial"> </Text>
          <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Font="Arial">הכל</Text>
          <Text>)</Text>
        </Paragraph>
      </DualDialogue>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8259e423-3c17-4f4f-8c62-3c53f65c2c1d">
      <Text>TabiTHA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="8f4ad70f-2a6a-43e8-b95f-312b8f9583f3">
      <Text>Anything, you just name it!
In your dreams:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="04532fad-160b-4812-ba61-8ba2acc1f0c8">
      <Text>DakoTA &amp; ROMANTICS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="8f4ad70f-2a6a-43e8-b95f-312b8f9583f3">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Hakol</Text>
      <Text> </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">efshari</Text>
      <Text>! (!</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Font="Arial">אפשרי</Text>
      <Text Font="Arial"> </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Font="Arial">הכל</Text>
      <Text>)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="daabccd8-b6c5-4607-9933-c1acf99c088c">
      <Text>Dakota</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="5f0ba6d9-b55f-4514-92fd-9d33b11f24a7">
      <Text>Naming...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c5854c0f-9c9b-476a-bc57-3f4fa5274991">
      <Text>Cleaning my room.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="153e6cca-11d8-4fb4-85f8-7f02922dc623">
      <Text>Tabitha</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="76bbfc5d-59c9-40f2-9ef7-a7f7278d7846">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Efshari</Text>
      <Text>! (!</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Font="Arial">אפשרי</Text>
      <Text>)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="dec8398f-3db2-4d58-924d-e535f7c7b357">
      <Text>Dakota</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1976570a-dcb5-4d68-8965-fee981f25058">
      <Text>Breaking the sound barrier.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="153e6cca-11d8-4fb4-85f8-7f02922dc623">
      <Text>Tabitha</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8c797cae-0352-4664-a66b-218dcb4396f7">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Efshari</Text>
      <Text>! (!</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Font="Arial">אפשרי</Text>
      <Text>)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2fab40fe-452c-4aae-8a24-1e5f96eb300a">
      <Text>DAKOTA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5c735764-823b-43f8-a822-9582ba967d35">
      <Text>Beating the speed of light!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="153e6cca-11d8-4fb4-85f8-7f02922dc623">
      <Text>Tabitha</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="521311e5-5ad5-4569-9d8a-aa163402e93d">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Efshari</Text>
      <Text>! (!</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Font="Arial">אפשרי</Text>
      <Text>)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3af217c7-edd3-4145-a02a-5523e2a999f3">
      <Text>DakOTA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e72a7f88-1acf-48a0-a477-c21afb6e486f">
      <Text>Winning the lottery!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="153e6cca-11d8-4fb4-85f8-7f02922dc623">
      <Text>Tabitha</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d630a96c-0a80-42b5-a135-6ae831315193">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Efshari</Text>
      <Text>! (!</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Font="Arial">אפשרי</Text>
      <Text>)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3df5ed00-a866-4f0b-a56f-e5c278995afa">
      <Text>DAKOTA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b8b8dd0c-4c2e-4ca5-b86c-5d8bd32c2718">
      <Text>Singing “Single Ladies” with Beyonce...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="153e6cca-11d8-4fb4-85f8-7f02922dc623">
      <Text>Tabitha</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a04a1761-0251-47be-8fe9-5019ad66d411">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Efshari</Text>
      <Text>! (!</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Font="Arial">אפשרי</Text>
      <Text>)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="44a3442f-1ff0-4647-b938-0379fb57b030">
      <Text>DAKOTA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2a24d6e9-08d7-483f-8bed-35d4f9d34b10">
      <Text>Producing my musical on Broadway!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="153e6cca-11d8-4fb4-85f8-7f02922dc623">
      <Text>Tabitha</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="72f4a12b-2078-48b3-8108-2f981f08bdc0">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Efshari</Text>
      <Text>! (!</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Font="Arial">אפשרי</Text>
      <Text>)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7f148f6a-1da7-42db-ab21-7d618bfe8cdd">
      <Text>DAKOTA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="199c7f36-6fef-461f-aa9e-e24f30a718f4">
      <Text>Canceling a gym membership!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="153e6cca-11d8-4fb4-85f8-7f02922dc623">
      <Text>Tabitha</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5b03a516-f9a8-410f-b325-9aaf22365cb9">
      <Text>You got me... “Gym,” is that a religion?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2cbfa6af-2b73-4bd2-ab1f-260d4cf51dc8">
      <Text>DAKOTA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="16882cb8-b06d-4caf-a797-dad74629a7d3">
      <Text>The gym is more like a cult.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="818326b8-8915-4c84-826f-67ace35a2d2e">
      <Text>TABITHA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8b2271a4-6783-4ae5-9e35-73011420e4fc">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Hakol</Text>
      <Text> </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">efshari</Text>
      <Text>!  (!</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Font="Arial">אפשרי</Text>
      <Text Font="Arial"> </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Font="Arial">הכל</Text>
      <Text>)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="dad028bb-4cce-4175-a734-05810da501b3">
      <Text>DAKOTA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5253f093-7120-45fb-b0e3-59c4df33ebc4">
      <Text>But speaking of cults... Family. My mother saying she is proud of me...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a4480b3f-75ef-49d9-95f9-c31e5834d67c">
      <Text>TABITHA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1d8f3e3c-6b18-495b-8220-6061a2732b4f">
      <Text>I’m sorry...
Now let’s ask the locals!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="38dd9bd9-2e63-4441-bfea-620837a318ca">
      <Text Style="Bold">Audience Engagement:</Text>
      <Text> If a member gives a decent answer, respond with “</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Efshari</Text>
      <Text>!” If a member gives an awful answer, respond with “F you dude!”</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="General" id="6ff80c69-0192-41cc-9522-1579b2501fdc">
      <Text Style="Underline">Example</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="633e1a47-01d9-4a6a-ba2c-8aa8110cfd96">
      <Text>Audience Member</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d7a74e17-8598-4417-b147-65e4cbc8e592">
      <Text>Getting a straight A this semester!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="98561ee7-f341-405d-9574-db5ed5d3baa0">
      <Text>Tabitha &amp; Dakota</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e68ee2f7-e34d-4170-bca0-277659c93049">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Efshari</Text>
      <Text>! (!</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Font="Arial">אפשרי</Text>
      <Text>)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b702b517-2bc6-432c-813c-a21cfd7910c4">
      <Text>AUDIENCE MEMBER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0bec5ae2-6692-4ad0-a8bd-f175cc7d4c26">
      <Text>Ending the world as we know it!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8c96fb4c-0996-4f4b-9c60-0d2b5d778468">
      <Text>TABITHA &amp; DAKOTA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ef310e5a-12a7-47b9-b87d-94b07fb9743c">
      <Text>F you dude!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="General" id="6ff80c69-0192-41cc-9522-1579b2501fdc">
      <Text Style="Underline">End Example</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d2bb2475-2969-4b89-8f29-609c782aaebc">
      <Text>Dakota gets out their guitar. Tabitha gets out her oud. Their instruments kiss.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="19c10b58-3309-4173-917d-6b9f19854fd6">
      <Text>DakoTA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="63c4ef75-1fe8-41c7-b248-88ca97f4cd0d">
      <Text>Time travel...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8384162b-240b-4965-bd2b-7cc6b2ce1feb">
      <Text>TABITHA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="af45f1df-1902-4e53-a368-b537a55d24b5">
      <Text>Ef-</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="efaf51ca-2360-41b5-b587-29c2a7862e2c">
      <Text>DAKOTA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="99530453-6603-4c22-8aa0-f922f0b617d1">
      <Text>...with you?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b40c59ce-78c2-4a24-a895-725cf95c5708">
      <Text>TABITHA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e504f825-0055-4697-8a69-7c0009eab084">
      <Text>Sweetie...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="bcc91b85-f7f2-4728-a764-361b871f5f6d">
      <Text>Tabitha and Dakota strum.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6d2c8996-95ee-42fe-95a6-bfc03ab3f0eb">
      <Text>RomANTICS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
